//   installPackage(A, \"1.0.0\", exactMatch=true).
// Error: Failed to load package A (1.0.0) using OPENMODELICALIBRARY (MODELICAPATH in the language specification) TestInstallMissingPackagesHome/.openmodelica/libraries.
//
// # Error encountered! Exiting...
// # Please check the error message and the flags.
// Failed to load library: A 1.0.0!
